<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="HEB" style="id">- Doondo</book>
  <para style="h">EBELEO</para>
  <para style="toc3">Ebe</para>
  <para style="toc2">Ebeleo</para>
  <para style="toc1">Mukanda ku bisi-Ebeleo</para>
  <para style="mt2">Mukanda ku ba-</para>
  <para style="mt1">Ebeleo</para>
  <para style="imt">Nkotolo</para>
  <para style="ip">Ewu ni mukanda wusonoko ku Bayudayo balanda nzila yi Klisto. Muntu bewowo wusonika wo kazabakani ko, kansi wu kedika ti muntu bewowo wutoma zaba Masonama, mu dyambu ti mu yandi bende kabongila kifwani mu balonka kikedika.</para>
  <para style="ip">Batoma vweza minkwikidi mintete natee bu basosa mu swama. Ni hahoho, muntu bewuwu kabasonika mukanda mu bateela bakangama nakekete, mu lembolo bika nzila.</para>
  <para style="ip">Mu ntangu yi zinkaka zeto, Nzambi wuyuwasana na Bayudayo nkumbu yimosi. Wubateela ti, tala ti muntu hodidi masumu, bafweti honda kibulu mu haana munkayulu, mpe Nzambi waalemvokila muntu bewowo. Mukanda bewuwu wuna nata ti nyuwasani yimoona yi sa Nzambi na bantu bakwikila mu Mwana, yivudidi na yintete. Mu dyambu ti, Yesu-Klisto misamu mi kahidikila bantu mivudidi na mi sa zimbazi, Mose, Aloni na Yoswa. Ni Yesu wuu Dimeme di Nzambi wubayekola mu dyambu di masumu ma bantu bamvimba. Kadi muntu waakwikila mu yandi, kasidi dyaka na nsatu ye haana munkayulu wu kibulu mu dyambu di masumu mandi ko. Nzambi waalemvokila masumu mandi.</para>
  <para style="iot">Ndandani yi mukanda bewuwu ebu yidi:</para>
  <para style="io1">1) Mwana Nzambi muntu wunene kadi (<char style="xt"><ref loc="HEB 1:1-3">1.1-3</ref></char>)</para>
  <para style="io1">2) Yesu vudidi zimbazi bunene (<char style="xt"><ref loc="HEB 1:4-2:18">1.4–2.18</ref></char>)</para>
  <para style="io1">3) Yesu vudidi Mose na Yoswa bunene (<char style="xt"><ref loc="HEB 3:1-4:13">3.1–4.13</ref></char>)</para>
  <para style="io1">4) Yesu wudi Mfumu nganga-Nzambi (<char style="xt"><ref loc="HEB 4:14-7:28">4.14–7.28</ref></char>)</para>
  <para style="io1">5) Yesu wuyiza na nyuwasani yivudidi na yintete (<char style="xt"><ref loc="HEB 8:1-9:22">8.1–9.22</ref></char>)</para>
  <para style="io1">6) Munkayulu wu Yesu wumosi kaka wudi mpe wudi wumanunu (<char style="xt"><ref loc="HEB 9:23-10:31">9.23–10.31</ref></char>)</para>
  <para style="io1">7) Bahiika ha kati di minkwikidi miminene mi ntama (<char style="xt"><ref loc="HEB 11:1-40">11.1-40</ref></char>)</para>
  <para style="io1">8) Tulandeeno kifwani ki Yesu (<char style="xt"><ref loc="HEB 12:1-13:19">12.1–13.19</ref></char>)</para>
  <para style="io1">9) Lusambulu na mbote zimanunu (<char style="xt"><ref loc="HEB 13:20-25">13.20-25</ref></char>)</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="HEB 1" />
  <para style="s1">Nzambi wutuzonzila mu Mwana andi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 1:1" />Mu ntama, Nzambi wedi zonzanga ku zinkaka zeto nkumbu zizingi na mu mitindu mimingi mu nzila yi mimbikudi. <verse eid="HEB 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 1:2" />Kansi mu ntangu beyiyi yi nsukunu, Nzambi wutuzonzila mu Mwana andi mpe mu dyambu dyandi kahidikila nza yimvimba na wumusoola mu byadila fwa dimvimba. <verse eid="HEB 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 1:3" />Mwana bewowo wuna lonka kulezima ku nkembo yi Nzambi, mpe wudi nkatika kifwani kina lonka Nzambi bonso bu kadi. Yandi simbidi bima bimvimba mu lulendo lu mpova andi. Bu kamana vedisa bantu mu masumu mawu, wuzakala ku mazulu ku kooko ku lubakala lu Nzambi yi lulendo lumvimba.<verse eid="HEB 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mwana wuvudila zimbazi kuzangama</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 1:4" />Mwana wuvudila zimbazi kuzangama, mu dyambu ti Nzambi wumuhaana nkumbu yihyokidi mfunu na yi yawu. <verse eid="HEB 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 1:5" />Mu dyambu ti Nzambi kata ku kani mbazi yimosi ko ti:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:5">«Ngeye Mwana ani wudi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:5">bubedidi neka Tata aku.»</para>
  <para style="m" vid="HEB 1:5">Mpe kata ku mbazi yimosi ko ti:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:5">«Meno naaba Tata ku yandi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:5">na yandi waaba Mwana ku meno.»<verse eid="HEB 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 1:6" />Kansi, mu ntangu Nzambi yikatambika Mwana andi wuntete mu nza, wuta ti:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:6">«Bika zimbazi zimvimba zi Nzambi zifukama ha ntadisi andi.»<verse eid="HEB 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 1:7" />Ku zimbazi wuta ti:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:7">«Wuna kitula zimbazi zandi bonso mupepe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:7">wuna kitula bisadi byandi bonso milaka mi tiya.»<verse eid="HEB 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 1:8" />Kansi mu dyambu di Mwana, wuta ti:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:8">«Oo Nzambi, kyandu ki kintinu kyaku, kidi mimvu ka mimvu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:8">Mu lunungu wuna yaadila kintinu kyaku.<verse eid="HEB 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 1:9" />Ngeye kwe tyanga lunungu na kwe belanga misamu mimbi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:9">Ni hahoho, Oo Nzambi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:9">Nzambi aku wukubyeka bu kakukusa mafuta ma kyese,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:9">wukusoola ha kati di bakundi baku.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1.9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lulendi tanga mpe</char><char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 45:7-8">Mik 45.7-8</ref></char></note>»<verse eid="HEB 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 1:10" />Wuta dyaka ti:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:10">«Mfumu, ngeye wuhidika butoto ku mbadukulu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:10">mpe mazulu ni kisalu ki moko maku.<verse eid="HEB 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 1:11" />Bimvimba bebyobyo byaazimbala, kansi ngeye wuna zinga mimvu ka mimvu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:11">Yulu na butoto byaafwa bonso bu kwe fwilanga kinkutu kinkulu.<verse eid="HEB 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 1:12" />Mbo wufutika byo bonso bu bakwe futikilanga kiyunga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:12">mbo wuhinga byo bonso bu bakwe hingisanga binkutu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:12">kansi ngeye waasanza ko na luzingu lwaku lwaaba na nsukunu ko.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1.12 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lulendi tanga mpe </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 102:26-28">Mik 102.26-28</ref></char></note>»<verse eid="HEB 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 1:13" />Nzambi kata ku kani mbazi yimosi ko ti:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:13">«Zakala ku lubakala lwani,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:13">natee bu nasa ti mitantu myaku</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:13">miba bitentokolo bi bitambi byaku.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1.13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lulendi tanga mpe </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 110:1">Mik 110.1</ref></char></note>»<verse eid="HEB 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 1:14" />Mbazi zi Nzambi mpeve zinaani zidi, zina sadila Nzambi: kwe tambikanga zo mu bakisa yobobo baatambula mpulusu bonso fwa.<verse eid="HEB 1:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="HEB 2" />
  <para style="s1">Mpulusu yiyinene</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 2:1" />Ni hahoho, tufweti kangama nakekete mu misamu mi tuyuwa, mwanki tulembolo zimbala. <verse eid="HEB 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 2:2" />Mu dyambu ti, Nzambi mambu ma kasamuna ku zinkaka zeto mu nzila yi zimbazi makedika madi. Wonso muntu wusafula mo mpe walembolo tumimina mo, wutambula kitumbu kifwanakani, <verse eid="HEB 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 2:3" />Buna bwedi twaavuukila tala ti tunyafuni mpulusu yiyinene beyoyo e? Mfumu, yandi bende wuntete wusamuna yo. Ku manima, bantu bebobo bayuwa Mfumu, batulonka makedika ma mpulusu beyoyo. <verse eid="HEB 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 2:4" />Mpe Nzambi wulonka makedika ma kimbangi kyawu mu bidimbu, mu misamu mingitukulu, mu bimangu bi mumpila-mumpila na mu minkayulu mi Mpeve Yilongo mi kahaana bonso buba luzolo lwandi.<verse eid="HEB 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu wututwadila mpulusu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 2:5" />Mu dyambu ti, ka ku nsye luyaalu lu zimbazi ko, Nzambi katuula nza yina kwiza ku mutwala, yi tuna zonzila. <verse eid="HEB 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 2:6" />Kuu na muntu mu Masonama wuta kimbangi eki:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 2:6">«Muntu, nani kadi mwanki wumubambukila moyo e?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 2:6">Hoti mwana muntu, nani kadi mwanki wumukeba e?<verse eid="HEB 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 2:7" />Mu mwa ntangu yifyoti, wumukulula ha ntadisi yi zimbazi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 2:7">mboki wumulwika mpu yi nkembo na yi nzitusu,<verse eid="HEB 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 2:8" />wutuula bima bimvimba ku nsye bitambi byandi.»</para>
  <para style="m" vid="HEB 2:8">Tala ti Nzambi wumuhaana luyaalu lu bima bimvimba, buna lonka ti kasisa kima kilembolo ba ku nsye luyaalu lwandi ko. Bwabu tuna yena ko ti bima bimvimba bituulu ku nsye luyaalu lwandi. <verse eid="HEB 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 2:9" />Kansi nki tuna yena e? Yesu mu mwa ntangu yifyoti, bamukulula ha ntadisi yi zimbazi, mboki bamulwika mpu yi nkembo na yi nzitusu. Bila nki e? Mu dyambu ti, wuyena mpasi na wufwa. Mpe mu mulemvo wu Nzambi, Yesu wufwa mu vuukisa bantu bamvimba. <verse eid="HEB 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 2:10" />Nzambi wuhidika bima bimvimba, mpe yandi vwidi bima bimvimba. Wusa ti kalungisa Yesu mu nzila yi zimpasi zi kayena, mu kotisa baala babingi mu nkembo andi. Mu dyambu ti mpulusu awu yifuma ku Yesu, mpe yandi wuna banata koko.<verse eid="HEB 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 2:11" />Buna, Yesu kwe vedisanga bantu mu masumu mawu na yobobo bameni vedoso, bamvimba Tata dimosi badi. Ni hahoho, Yesu kana yena nsoni ko mu batumisina zimpangi zandi, <verse eid="HEB 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 2:12" />bu kata ti:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 2:12">«Mbo nasamuna nkumbu aku ku zimpangi zani,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 2:12">mbo nakukembisa ha kati di bundu di bantu.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2.12 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lulendi tanga mu</char><char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 22:23">Mik 22.23</ref></char></note>»<verse eid="HEB 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 2:13" />Wuta mpe ti:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 2:13">«Mbo nasa kivuvu kyani mu Nzambi.»</para>
  <para style="m" vid="HEB 2:13">Wuta dyaka ti:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 2:13">«Meno ewu, ha kimosi na baala bampaana Nzambi.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2.13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lulendi tanga mu</char><char style="xt"><ref loc="ISA 8:17-18">Yes 8.17-18</ref></char></note>»<verse eid="HEB 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 2:14" />Bu tuzebi ti baala bebobo bamvimba baa na nsuni na menga, Yesu mpe yandi bende wuyiza ba muntu bonso yawu, mu lufwa lwandi, wubedisa Nkadyampemba wuu na ngolo ze honda bantu. <verse eid="HEB 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 2:15" />Ni bwabobo kakuudila yobobo baba, luzingu lwawu lumvimba, ku nsye kinanga mu dyambu di bunkuta bu lufwa. <verse eid="HEB 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 2:16" />Mu dyambu ti, kayiza mu sadisa zimbazi ko, kansi mu sadisa baala baa mu nkuna yi Abalahami. <verse eid="HEB 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 2:17" />Ni hahoho, kafweti fwanakana mu mimvimba bonso zimpangi zandi, mwanki kiza kaba Mfumu Nganga-Nzambi wufuluka mu nkenda, mpe kaba muntu wulunungu mu kisalu kyandi ha ntadisi yi Nzambi, mwanki katula masumu ma bantu. <verse eid="HEB 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 2:18" />Mu dyambu ti, Yesu yandi bende wuyena mpasi bu bamutonta. Ni hahoho, yandi lendi sadisa bantu baa mu ntontolo.<verse eid="HEB 2:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="HEB 3" />
  <para style="s1">Yesu na Mose</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 3:1" />Zimpangi, yeno luvwihulu ku Nzambi, lutambula mbokolo yifuma ku mazulu. Tadiseeno bwabu ku Yesu wudi Ntumwa na Mfumu Nganga-Nzambi yi kiminu kyeto ki tuna kwe samuni. <verse eid="HEB 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 3:2" />Wuba wukwikama ha ntadisi yi Nzambi wumusoola, bonso Mose bu kaba wukwikama mu nzo yimvimba yi Nzambi. <verse eid="HEB 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 3:3" />Kansi, Yesu fweti kemboso kuhyoka Mose, mu dyambu ti kitungi kwe zitusungu kuhyoka nzo yi katungidi. <verse eid="HEB 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 3:4" />Kadi nzo, kuu na muntu wutunga yo. Kansi yondowo wuhidika bima bimvimba, ni Nzambi. <verse eid="HEB 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 3:5" />Mose wuba muntu wukwikama mu nzo yimvimba yi Nzambi, mpe wuba mbangi mu mpova Nzambi zi kakana mu ta. <verse eid="HEB 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 3:6" />Kansi Klisto wukwikama kadi, bonso Mwana Tata andi wu kaheeni nzo andi mu yaala. Mpe nzo andi ni yeto, tala ti tuu na kibakala, na tuna sa kivuvu mu mpova zina tuyangidika.<verse eid="HEB 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kuhuma kusila Nzambi nsilulu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 3:7" />Ni hahoho, Mpeve Yilongo kateela ti:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 3:7">«Bubedidi, tala ti luyudi ndinga yi Nzambi,<verse eid="HEB 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 3:8" />lukangandi mitima myeno ko, bonso zinkaka zeno bu zimunangumukina mu ntangu yi ntontolo ku nsi yinkatu.<verse eid="HEB 3:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 3:9" />Kokoko ku ntonta na ku nsokotina zinkaka zeno, mpeleko ziyena bimangu bi nahidika<verse eid="HEB 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 3:10" />mu mvula makumaya.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 3:10">Ni hahoho, nafwemina mbandu beyoyo, mpe nina ta ti:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 3:10">“Bika mayindu mawu matatamana mu ba mazimbala,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 3:10">mu dyambu ti yawu babakula nzila zani ko.”<verse eid="HEB 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 3:11" />Ku nsye mankesi mani, ni nadya ndefi ti:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 3:11">Baakota kani fyoti ko mu nsi yi nabakubikila mwanki bahuma!»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3.11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lulendi tanga mu </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 95:7-11">Mik 95.7-11</ref></char></note><verse eid="HEB 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 3:12" />Zimpangi kebeeno kweno, nakani muntu ha kati dyeno, kabandi na mutima wumbi ko, kabisandi mu kwikila, mpe wuna sa ti kateka Nzambi yimoyo manima. <verse eid="HEB 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 3:13" />Kansi syamasaneeno yeno na yeno kadi kilumbu ki bakwe tumisinanga ti «bubedidi», mwanki nakani muntu ha kati dyeno kabandi na mutima ngolo, na kakotandi mu mpukumunu zi masumu. <verse eid="HEB 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 3:14" />Mu dyambu ti tuhikidi kintwadi na Klisto, tala ti tukangamani nakekete natee ku nsukunu, mu kivuvu kyeto kintete ki tubaka tuka ku mbadukulu.<verse eid="HEB 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 3:15" />Bonso bu wudi wusonama ti:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 3:15">«Bubedidi, tala ti luyudi ndinga yi Nzambi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 3:15">lukangandi mitima myeno ko,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 3:15">bonso zinkaka zeno bu zimunangumukina.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3.15 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lulendi tanga mpe mu </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 95:7-8">Mik 95.7-8</ref></char></note>»<verse eid="HEB 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 3:16" />Yobobo banani badi bayuwa ndinga yi Nzambi na bamunangumukina e? Ni bantu bebobo bamvimba baduukisa Mose ku nsi yi Ngipiti. <verse eid="HEB 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 3:17" />Ba nani Nzambi kafwemina mu mvula makumaya e? Wufwemina yobobo basumuka na bafwa mu nsi yinkatu. <verse eid="HEB 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 3:18" />Ku ba nani Nzambi kadila ndefi ti: «Balendi kota mu nsi yi kabakubikila mu huma ko e?» Ni ku yobobo bamunangumukina.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3.18 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lulendi tanga mpe </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="NUM 14:1-35">Ltg 14.1-35</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 95:11">Mik 95.11</ref></char> </note> <verse eid="HEB 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 3:19" />Mpe tubakudi ti balenda mu kota mu nsi yi babakubikila ko mu bahumisa, mu dyambu ti babisa mu kwikila.<verse eid="HEB 3:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="HEB 4" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 4:1" />Buna Nzambi wutusiila nsilulu ti twaakota mu kuhuma ku katukubikila. Ni hahoho, tukebeeno kweto mwanki nakani muntu ha kati dyeno kalembakanandi mu kota. <verse eid="HEB 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 4:2" />Mu dyambu ti tutambula mpova zi Nzambi, bonso bu yuwila zo yobobo baba ku nsi yi nkatu. Kansi, bu bayuwa zo, babakila zo ndandu ko, mu dyambu ti bantu batambula zo mu kiminu ko. <verse eid="HEB 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 4:3" />Yeto tuna kwikila, twaakota mu kuhuma bekoko Nzambi ku kateela ti:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 4:3">«Mu mankesi mani nadya ndefi eyi:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 4:3">balendi kota mu kuhuma kwani ku nabakubikila ko<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4.3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lulendi tanga mpe mu</char><char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 95:11">Mik 95.11</ref></char></note>!»</para>
  <para style="m" vid="HEB 4:3">Wakateedi, mpeleko kisalu kyandi kimanisa tuka bu kahidika nza.<verse eid="HEB 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 4:4" />Mu dyambu ti wudi wusonama mu buuku di Nzambi mu myo mitadidi kilumbu kinsambwadi ti: «Mu kilumbu kinsambwadi, Nzambi wuhuma mu kisalu kyandi kimvimba kye hidika bima.» <verse eid="HEB 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 4:5" />Wusonama mpe mu kibuku kitekidi ti: «Bakota nakani mu kuhuma kwani ku nabakubikila ko.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4.5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lulendi tanga mpe mu</char><char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 95:11">Mik 95.11</ref></char></note>» <verse eid="HEB 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 4:6" />Bantu bebobo baba bantete mu yuwa mpova zi Nzambi, bakota ko mu kuhuma bekoko, mu dyambu ti babisa mu tumama. Ni hahoho, bantu bahiika bakidi dyaka na hwahwa mu kota momo. <verse eid="HEB 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 4:7" />Ni hahoho, Nzambi kazengila dyaka kilumbu kimosi ki kana tumisina ti «bubedidi». Wakazonzila tuka ntama mu munwa wu Davidi mu kibuku kitekidi ti:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 4:7">«Bubedidi, tala ti luyuwidi ndinga yi Nzambi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 4:7">lukangandi mitima myeno ko.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4.7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lulendi tanga mpe mu</char><char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 95:11">Mik 95.11</ref></char></note>»<verse eid="HEB 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 4:8" />Kedika tala ti Yoswa wutwadisa mukangu wu Isaeli mu kuhuma bekoko<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4.8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lulendi tanga mpe mu</char><char style="xt"><ref loc="DEU 31:7">Mis 31.7</ref>; <ref loc="JOS 22:4">Yos 22.4</ref></char></note>, nganunu Nzambi kazonzila dyaka kilumbu kihiika ko. <verse eid="HEB 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 4:9" />Bwabobo mpe kuhuma kufwanakani na kuhuma ku kilumbu kinsambwadi Nzambi ku kahaana ku mukangu. <verse eid="HEB 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 4:10" />Mu dyambu ti yondowo kwe kotanga mu kuhuma ku Nzambi, kwe bikanga mu sala kisalu kyandi mwanki kahuma, bonso Nzambi bu kahumina mu kisalu kyandi. <verse eid="HEB 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 4:11" />Bwabu tuseeno ngolo mu kota mu kuhuma bekoko, mwanki nakani muntu kalembolo bwa, bonso bu bwila bantu bebobo babisa mu tumimina Nzambi.<verse eid="HEB 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 4:12" />Wukedika ti Mambu ma Nzambi moyo na ngolo madi. Mavudidi meeno kuhyoka mbele yiyila yilwenga, yii na meeno mu ndambu ka ndambu. Mambu ma Nzambi makwe kotanga natee bu mahambula mwela na mpeve, makolo ma bihisi na muhuba. Kwe yenikisanga nsatu na mabanza maa ku nsye mutima wu muntu. <verse eid="HEB 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 4:13" />Mu bimvimba bihidika Nzambi, kunaani kima kilendi swama ha meso mandi. Bimvimba bikwe yenikanga ha meso mandi, mpe ku yandi twaahaana mvutu mu mimvimba mi tukwe sanga.<verse eid="HEB 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Mfumu Nganga-Nzambi eto kadi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 4:14" />Mu dyambu ti, tudi na Mfumu Nganga-Nzambi yimosi yikota ku mazulu natee ku Nzambi, ni Yesu, Mwana-Nzambi. Ni hahoho, tukangameeno nakekete mu kiminu ki tuna samuna. <verse eid="HEB 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 4:15" />Ninga, Mfumu Nganga-Nzambi yii neto, yikwe yenanga mpasi ha kimosi neto. Yandi bamutonta mu mimvimba bonso bu bana tutontila yeto mpe. Kansi, kasumuka ko. <verse eid="HEB 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 4:16" />Bwabu, tufinameeno na kivuvu kimvimba ku kyandu ki kintinu ki Nzambi, yandi kwe lonkanga ku bantu mambote mandi. Mbo katufwila nkenda na mbo katulonka mulemvo andi, mwanki katusadisa mu ntangu yi fwanakani.<verse eid="HEB 4:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="HEB 5" />
  <para style="s">Yesu, Mfumu Nganga-Nzambi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 5:1" />Kadi mfumu nganga-Nzambi, ha kati di bantu bakwe mu soodilanga. Mpe kisalu kyandi ni mu sadila Nzambi mu dyambu dyawu. Yandi kwe haananga ku Nzambi makabu na minkayulu mu dyambu di masumu ma bantu. <verse eid="HEB 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 5:2" />Lendi fwila nkenda bantu bebobo bazimbakani nzila na yobobo baa ku nsye bunzimbu, mu dyambu ti yandi bende, muntu kwandi kadi wulenda lebakana. <verse eid="HEB 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 5:3" />Mu dyambu ti wulebakana kadi yandi bende, fweti haananga minkayulu, ka mu dyambu di masumu ma bantu kaka ko, kansi na ma yandi bende mpe. <verse eid="HEB 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 5:4" />Kunaani muntu wulendi kihaana nzitusu mu ba mfumu nganga-Nzambi. Kansi, fweti teka tambula mbokolo yi Nzambi, bonso bu kasa ku Aloni.<verse eid="HEB 5:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 5:5" />Klisto mpe ka kizangula yandi bende ko mu ba mfumu nganga-Nzambi. Kansi ni Nzambi wumuteela ti:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 5:5">Ngeye Mwana ani wudi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 5:5">Bubedidi neka Tata aku.<verse eid="HEB 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 5:6" />Mpe wubwesa ta dyaka ti:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 5:6">«Weka Nganga-Nzambi mimvu ka mimvu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 5:6">mu mulonga wu Melekisedeki.»<verse eid="HEB 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 5:7" />Mu luzingu lwandi lumvimba ha luse lu butoto, Yesu wedi sambilanga na wedi bombidilanga mu ndinga yingolo na manswela mu meso, ku Nzambi wulenda muvuukisa mu lufwa. Mpe Nzambi wumuyuwila mu dyambu di luyinunu lwandi. <verse eid="HEB 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 5:8" />Mpeleko wuba Mwana-Nzambi, kansi wulongoka lutumumu mu mpasi zandi. <verse eid="HEB 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 5:9" />Yesu bu kayiza ba wulunga, wukituka nto yi mpulusu yi mimvu ka mimvu ku bantu bebobo bamvimba bakwe mutumiminanga. <verse eid="HEB 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 5:10" />Kadi Nzambi wumutumisina Mfumu Nganga-Nzambi mu mulonga wu Melekisedeki.<verse eid="HEB 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kutambula bindya bizita</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 5:11" />Mimingi mye ta mii neto mu musamu bewuwu, kansi mpasi mu luhaanina myo mbangudulu, mu dyambu ti luhikidi na lebakani mu bakula. <verse eid="HEB 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 5:12" />Ntangu zizingi luhyokisa mwanki luba milongisi, kansi lwakidi dyaka na nsatu balulonga misamu mintete mi mambu ma Nzambi. Lwakidi dyaka na nsatu ye nwa mamvumina, kansi ka bindya bizita ko. <verse eid="HEB 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 5:13" />Yondowo kwe nwanga kaka mamvumina, wakidi mwa mwana wunsombe, mpe kadi wulongoka mu misamu mitadidi lunungu ko. <verse eid="HEB 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 5:14" />Kansi bindya bizita, bantu bakula bakwe dyanga byo, yawu mu nsadulu awu, badi na mpisulu mu swasisa misamu mimbote na mimbi.<verse eid="HEB 5:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="HEB 6" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 6:1" />Ni hahoho, tubikeeno ndongosolo yintete yitadidi Klisto, tusoseeno yo yifwanakani ku bantu bakula. Kansi tubwesandi vutukila ndongosolo yintama ko, bonso kuvilula madyela, kubiika nsadulu zifwa, kukwikila mu Nzambi, <verse eid="HEB 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 6:2" />ndongosolo yitadidi mbotokolo na ntentokolo yi moko, mfulukulu mu bafwa na mfundusu yi mimvu ka mimvu. <verse eid="HEB 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 6:3" />Bwabobo twaasila tala ti Nzambi heeni luve.<verse eid="HEB 6:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 6:4" />Mu dyambu bulendi ba ko ti bantu batambula kya ku Nzambi, babimba munkayulu wu mazulu, mpe baba kintwadi na Mpeve Yilongo, <verse eid="HEB 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 6:5" />babimba Mambu ma Nzambi mambote na lulendo lu mimvu mina kwiza kuntwala, <verse eid="HEB 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 6:6" />na babwesa bwa dyaka. Bulendi ba ko ti bakituka dyaka nkumbu yinzole bantu bamoona, bakoma dyaka ha kulunsi Mwana-Nzambi mu dyambu di mvilukulu awu, mpe bamutuka ha meso ma bantu.<verse eid="HEB 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 6:7" />Tala ti butoto bukwe nokonongo mvula kadi ntangu bumenisi bikunu bii mfunu ku yobobo basedi mfuba, Nzambi bwa kasakumuni. <verse eid="HEB 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 6:8" />Kansi tala ti butoto bumenisi nsende na mpanga, busidi dyaka mfunu ko, bweka bela-bela na nsingulu, mpe mbo bayoka bo ku tiya.<verse eid="HEB 6:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 6:9" />Zimpangi zizola, ni tuzonzila bobo, tukwikidi ti yeno mu nzila yimbote ludi, yo yikwe natanga ku mpulusu. <verse eid="HEB 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 6:10" />Nzambi wulunungu kadi. Kalendi zimbakana kisalu kyeno na luzolo lu lulonkidi mu nkumbu andi ko, sungula mu mambote ma luhidikidi, mpe ma luna tatamana mu hidika ku bantu bavwihulu ku Nzambi. <verse eid="HEB 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 6:11" />Kansi tutiidi ti kadi muntu mu yeno katatamana mu lonka vema kubobo natee ku nsukunu, mwanki kivuvu kyeno kilunga. <verse eid="HEB 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 6:12" />Bwabu lubandi bantu balebakana ko. Kansi, landeeno kifwani ki bantu bana tatamana mu kiminu, mpe bana tambula nsilulu zi basila Nzambi.<verse eid="HEB 6:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nsilulu yi Nzambi na kivuvu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 6:13" />Nzambi bu kasa nsilulu ku Abalahami, mu nkumbu yi yandi bende kadila ndefi andi, mu dyambu ti kuba na muntu ko wu muvudila bunene, wu kaketi dila ndefi. <verse eid="HEB 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 6:14" />Wuta ti: «Ndidi ndefi mu kusakumuna bubwingi na mu funisa nkuna aku!» <verse eid="HEB 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 6:15" />Abalahami wuvibidila na wutambula byo bi musila Nzambi nsilulu. <verse eid="HEB 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 6:16" />Bantu bu bakwe dyanga ndefi, mu nkumbu yi muntu wu bavudidi bunene bakwe dilanga yo. Ndefi kidimbu kidi kikwe manisanga mpaka. <verse eid="HEB 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 6:17" />Kansi, Nzambi wutya mu lonka dyaka ku bantu ba kasiila nsilulu ti, nzengolo andi yilendi kituka ko. Ni hahoho, kadila ndefi. <verse eid="HEB 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 6:18" />Ndefi na nsilulu, bima byole bidi bikwe lembolo kitukanga, mu bima bebibi, nakani Nzambi kalendi huna ko. Ku yeto tuswamini mu yandi, bana tusyamisa bubwingi mu kangama nakekete mu kivuvu Nzambi ki katusila nsilulu. <verse eid="HEB 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 6:19" />Kivuvu bekyokyo kidi ku yeto bonso kisengo kikwe sikikanga luzingu lweto. Kidi kikangama nakekete, mpe kikwe hambulanga mulele wu nzo-Nzambi yi mazulu natee mu kihinga ki nkatika kilongo. <verse eid="HEB 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="HEB 6:20" />Momo Yesu katutekidila mu kota. Wukota momo mu dyambu dyeto, mpe wuyiza ba Mfumu Nganga-Nzambi yi mimvu ka mimvu mu mulonga wu Melekisedeki.<verse eid="HEB 6:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="HEB 7" />
  <para style="s1">Melekisedeki, ntinu na nganga-Nzambi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 7:1" />Melekisedeki bewowo, wuba ntinu yi Salemi na nganga-Nzambi yi Nzambi Yihyokidi Kuzangama, wuyenda bwana Abalahami bu kedi kwiza vutuki ku manima me bedisa zintinu. Melekisedeki wusakumuna Abalahami. <verse eid="HEB 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 7:2" />Ku yandi Abalahami kahaana kibuku ki kumi-kumi mu bima bimvimba bi kabaka. Mbangudulu yi nkumbu yi Melekisedeki wudi ntete «ntinu yi lunungu», mboki wudi ntinu yi Salemi mpila mosi ti, «ntinu yi kiyenge». <verse eid="HEB 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 7:3" />Kaa na tata na ngudi ko, mpe kaa na nkuna ko. Kaa na mbandukulu na nsukunu ko. Kansi fwanakani na Mwana-Nzambi, mpe wudi nganga-Nzambi yi mimvu ka mimvu.<verse eid="HEB 7:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 7:4" />Taleeno bwedi kadi wuzangama! Nkaka eto Abalahami wumuhaana [mpe] kibuku ki kumi-kumi mu bima bi kabaka ku kaba mu nwana mvita. <verse eid="HEB 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 7:5" />Kansi, yobobo badi zinganga-Nzambi mu nkuna yi Levi, Misiku mina bahaana luve mu lomba kibuku ki kumi-kumi ku baala ba-Isaeli, mpila mosi ti ku zimpangi zi yawu bende zidi mpe mu nkuna yi Abalahami. <verse eid="HEB 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 7:6" />Yandi Melekisedeki kaba mu nkuna yi Levi ko, kansi Abalahami wumuhaana kibuku ki kumi-kumi mu bima bi kabaka. Mpe wusakumuna yondowo wutambula nsilulu zi Nzambi. <verse eid="HEB 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 7:7" />Kansi wulembolo sa maketiketi, yondowo kwe sakumunanga hyokidi kuzangama na yondowo wu bana sakumuna. <verse eid="HEB 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 7:8" />Bantu ba nkuna yi Levi bakwe tambulanga kibuku ki kumi-kumi ki bimvwama, badi bantu bakwe fwanga. Kansi, Melekisedeki wutambula kibuku ki kumi-kumi bekyokyo mu moko ma Abalahami, moyo kadi bonso bu wudi wusonama. <verse eid="HEB 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 7:9" />Mu manisa, bantu ba nkuna yi Levi bakwe tambulanga kibuku ki kumi-kumi ki bimvwama, tulendi ta ti, yawu mpe kyabafuta mu ntangu Abalahami bu kafuta kyo. <verse eid="HEB 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 7:10" />Mu dyambu ti, tekila Levi kabutuka, yandi wuba mu luketo lu nkaka andi Abalahami mu ntangu Melekisedeki yi kamubwana.<verse eid="HEB 7:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 7:11" />Misiku mi bahaana ku mukangu wu Isaeli, mizakala mu kinganga-Nzambi ki nkuna yi Levi. Kansi, tala ti zinganga-Nzambi zi nkuna yi Levi zisala kisalu kimbote, nganunu kuduuka nganga-Nzambi yihiika ko mu mulonga wu Melekisedeki, kansi ka mu mulonga wu Aloni ko. <verse eid="HEB 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 7:12" />Mu dyambu ti, bu bakwe sanzanga kinganga-Nzambi, bafweti sanza mpe Misiku. <verse eid="HEB 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 7:13" />Misamu bemimi misonama mu dyambu di Mfumu eto. Yandi vwihulu mu kifumba kyaka kyasedi kisalu ki kinganga-Nzambi ha ziku di bakwe yokilanga minkayulu. <verse eid="HEB 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 7:14" />Wutoma zabakana wudi ti, Mfumu eto mu kifumba ki Yuda kadi, mpe Mose kata nakani musamu ko mu kifumba ki Yuda bu kazonzila mu zinganga-Nzambi.<verse eid="HEB 7:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nganga-Nzambi yihiika yifwanakana na Melekisedeki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 7:15" />Misamu mina lonka makedika mu mimvimba bemyomyo ni emi: nganga-Nzambi yihiika yiyiza yidi yifwanakana na Melekisedeki. <verse eid="HEB 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 7:16" />Kayiza ba nganga-Nzambi, mu dyambu di misiku mitadidi nkuna yi bantu ko, kansi bamubyeka nganga-Nzambi mu lulendo lu luzingu lulembolo ba na nsukunu. <verse eid="HEB 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 7:17" />Mu dyambu ti, Masonama mana ta ti:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 7:17">«Waaba nganga-Nzambi mimvu ka mimvu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 7:17">mu mulonga wu Melekisedeki<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7.17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lulendi tanga mpe mu</char><char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 110:4">Mik 110.4</ref></char></note>.»<verse eid="HEB 7:17" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 7:18" />Buna Nzambi wukatula Misiku mintete mu dyambu ti miba ngolo na mfunu ko. <verse eid="HEB 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 7:19" />Mu dyambu ti, Misiku mi Mose minata nakani kima kimosi ko mu ba kilunga. Ni hahoho ha kibuka ki Misiku, tubakila kivuvu kihyokidi kitezo, mu kyawu tweka bela-bela na Nzambi.<verse eid="HEB 7:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="HEB 7:20" />Mpe Nzambi ndefi yakadya. Bantu bahiika bababyeka zinganga-Nzambi, badya ndefi beyoyo ko. <verse eid="HEB 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="HEB 7:21" />Kansi Yesu, bamubyeka Nganga-Nzambi mu ndefi yi bamudila ku Nzambi bu kata ti:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 7:21">«Mfumu wudya ndefi na kalendi sanza mpova andi ko:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 7:21">“Wudi Nganga-Nzambi, mimvu ka mimvu.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7.21 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lulendi tanga mpe mu </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 110:4">Mik 110.4</ref></char></note>”»<verse eid="HEB 7:21" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="HEB 7:22" />Ni hahoho, Yesu wuhikidi mpe muntu wubunda ntulu mu luwawanu luhyokidi lumbote.<verse eid="HEB 7:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="HEB 7:23" />Musamu wuhiika wu diswaswani ni ewu: nganga-Nzambi zizingi zedi hingananga, mu dyambu ti lufwa lwedi bakakidilanga mu tatamana mu sala kisalu kyawu. <verse eid="HEB 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="HEB 7:24" />Kansi Yesu wuna zinga mimvu ka mimvu, mpe kinganga-Nzambi kyandi kilendi kituka ko. <verse eid="HEB 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="HEB 7:25" />Ni hahoho, lendi vuukisa kimankululu bantu bana finama ku Nzambi mu nzila andi, mu dyambu ti, wudi wumoyo ntangu zimvimba mu badiila mvutu ku Nzambi.<verse eid="HEB 7:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="HEB 7:26" />Buba bufwanakana ku yeto mu ba na Mfumu Nganga-Nzambi yibobo, wudi Wulongo, wulembolo ba na kibila, wulembolo sumuka, mpe wudi kitatu na minsumuki na wuzangama kuhyoka mazulu. <verse eid="HEB 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="HEB 7:27" />Kaa na nsatu ko mu haananga kadi kilumbu minkayulu bonso zimfumu nganga-Nzambi zihiika, ntete mu dyambu di masumu ma yandi bende, mboki masumu ma mukangu. Yesu nkumbu yimosi kaka kasa bobo ki mankululu, bu kakiyekola yandi bende. <verse eid="HEB 7:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="HEB 7:28" />Misiku mi Mose mikwe byekanga zimfumu nganga-Nzambi bantu balembolo ba balunga. Kansi, ndefi yidya Nzambi mu mpova ku manima ma Misiku, yibyeka Mfumu Nganga-Nzambi Mwana wu kalungisa mimvu ka mimvu.<verse eid="HEB 7:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="HEB 8" />
  <para style="s1">Yesu wudi Mfumu Nganga-Nzambi eto</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 8:1" />Dyambu di ngudi di tuna ta ni edi: tuu na Mfumu Nganga-Nzambi yibobobo yizakadi ku kooko ku lubakala lu kyandu ki kintinu ki Nzambi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8.1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lulendi tanga mpe mu</char><char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 110:1">Mik 110.1</ref></char></note> yizangama mu mazulu. <verse eid="HEB 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 8:2" />Yandi wuna sala kisalu kyandi mu kihinga kilongo, mpila mosi mu nzo yi kikapu yikedika, yitungu ku Mfumu, kansi ka ku muntu ko.<verse eid="HEB 8:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 8:3" />Mu dyambu ti, kadi mfumu nganga-Nzambi bamubyeka mu haananga makabu na minkayulu. Ni hahoho, yandi mpe fweti banga na kima kye haana. <verse eid="HEB 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 8:4" />Kansi tala ti wuba ha luse lu butoto, nganunu kaketi ba nakani nganga-Nzambi ko, mu dyambu ti kudi na zihiika zikwe haananga makabu bonso buna tumina Misiku mi Mose. <verse eid="HEB 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 8:5" />Kisalu kikwe salanga zinganga-Nzambi bezizi, kifwani hoti kinsinsya ki bima bii ku mazulu. Kifwanakani na misamu Nzambi mi kateela ku Mose mu tunga nzo yi kikapu. Nzambi wumuteela ti: «Toma tala na hidika mimvimba bonso kifwani ki nakulonka ha yulu mulandu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8.5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lulendi tanga mpe mu</char><char style="xt"><ref loc="EXO 25:40">Ndu 25.40</ref></char></note>.» <verse eid="HEB 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 8:6" />Kansi bwabu, Yesu bamuheeni kisalu kivudidi bunene, kye ba muwawisi wu luwawanu luhyokidi kitezo na lusikamani mu zinsilulu zihyokidi kitezo.<verse eid="HEB 8:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 8:7" />Tala ti luwawanu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8.7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lulendi tanga mpe mu</char><char style="xt"><ref loc="EXO 24:3-8">Ndu 24.3-8</ref></char></note> luntete luba lulunga, nganunu kubandi mfunu ko mu hingisa lunzole. <verse eid="HEB 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 8:8" />Kansi, bonso masembo Nzambi kedi haana ku mukangu bu kata ti:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 8:8">«Bilumbu bina kwiza, Mfumu teedi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 8:8">bi naatunga ha kimosi na nzo yi Isaeli,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 8:8">mpe na nzo yi Yuda, luwawanu lumoona.<verse eid="HEB 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 8:9" />Lwaaba bonso luwawanu lu natunga na matata mawu ko,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 8:9">kilumbu ki nabasimba mu kooko mu baduukisa mu nsi yi Ngipiti.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 8:9">Mu dyambu ti baa bakangama mu luwawanu belolo ko,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 8:9">meno mpe ni nabateka manima, Mfumu teedi.<verse eid="HEB 8:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 8:10" />Kansi tala bwedi bwabela luwawanu lu naatunga ha kimosi na nzo yi Isaeli,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 8:10">ku manima ma bilumbu bebyobyo, Mfumu teedi:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 8:10">Naatuula Misiku myani mu mayindu mawu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 8:10">naasonika myo mu mitima myawu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 8:10">mpe naaba Nzambi awu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 8:10">na yawu baaba mukangu ani.<verse eid="HEB 8:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 8:11" />Kunaani muntu waahaana dyaka ndongosolo ku munandi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 8:11">hoti ku mpangi andi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 8:11">mu ta ti: “Zaba Mfumu!”</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 8:11">Mu dyambu ti bamvimba baanzaba,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 8:11">kutonina ku mwana wufyoti natee ku kihunda.<verse eid="HEB 8:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 8:12" />Mu dyambu ti naabalemvokila mambi mawu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 8:12">mpe naabwesa bambukila moyo masumu mawu ko<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8.12 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lulendi tanga mpe mu </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="JER 31:31-34">Yel 31.31-34</ref></char></note>.»<verse eid="HEB 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 8:13" />Luwawanu, bu batumisini lo ti lumoona, Nzambi kitudi bwabu luntete luntama. Tuzebi ti, kima kintama na kinunini, kyeka bela-bela mu zimbala.<verse eid="HEB 8:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="HEB 9" />
  <para style="s1">Nsambudulu yi ha butoto na yi ku yulu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 9:1" />Luwawanu luntete luba na ntumunu ze sambidila Nzambi mpe na nzo yilongo ha butoto. <verse eid="HEB 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 9:2" />Nzo yi kikapu batunga, yiba na bihinga byole. Kihinga kintete bedi tumisinanga kyo ti: kibuka kilongo. Mu kati muba kitentokolo ki minda, meza na mampa ma bahaana minkayulu ku Nzambi. <verse eid="HEB 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 9:3" />Ku manima ma mulele wunzole, kuba na kihinga kihiika ki bakwe tumisinanga ti: kibuka kihyokidi kilongo, <verse eid="HEB 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 9:4" />mu kati muba na kuku di wola di bakwe yokilanga maaka ma mfuku yimbote na nkela yi luwawanu yi balenga wola. Mu kati di nkela, muba na ndonga yi wola yiba na maana, muhangu wu Aloni wuduukisa bifulu na mwa matadi ma basonika Misiku mi luwawanu. <verse eid="HEB 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 9:5" />Ha yulu nkela, haba na mwa biteki bi bakeluba byedi lonkanga nkembo yi Nzambi, biba na mahahi mayalumuka medi haananga mposi ha yulu kibuka ki bedi haaninanga menga ma minkayulu mu ndemvokolo yi masumu. Kansi ntangu yafweni ko mu zonzila misamu bemyomyo mimvimba.<verse eid="HEB 9:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 9:6" />Ni bwabobo bakubikila bima bimvimba. Kadi ntangu zinganga-Nzambi zedi kotanga mu kihinga kintete ki kikapu, mu sala kisalu kyawu. <verse eid="HEB 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 9:7" />Kansi mfumu nganga-Nzambi kwandi wedi kotanga mu kihinga kinzole ki kihinga yi kikapu nkumbu yimosi kaka mu mumvu. Wedi natanga mu kati menga ma kibulu ma kahaana bonso munkayulu ku Nzambi, mu dyambu di yandi bende na masumu ma mukangu. <verse eid="HEB 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 9:8" />Mpeve Yilongo wuna lonka ti, nzila yi kibuka kihyokidi kilongo yazibukidi ko, tala ti nzo yintete yi kikapu yakidi. <verse eid="HEB 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 9:9" />Kyokyokyo kifwani ki misamu mi ntangu beyiyi. Kina lonka ti makabu na minkayulu mi bakwe haananga ku Nzambi, bilendi sa ko ti mayindu maba malunga, ma yondowo kwe sambidilanga mu mutindu bewowo. <verse eid="HEB 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 9:10" />Ntumunu zi bantu kwandi zidi zitadidi kudya, kunwa na mvedosolo yi nitu yi mumpila-mumpila. Ziba kwandi mu mwa ntangu, nsadulu zi bakwika bantu natee ntangu Nzambi yi kaahinga misamu mimvimba.<verse eid="HEB 9:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 9:11" />Kansi, Klisto wuyiza bonso Mfumu Nganga-Nzambi yi bimvwama bidi. Yandi wukota mu nzo yi kikapu yivudidi mfunu na yitoma lunga, yilembolo tunga bantu, mpila mosi ti, yidi yi nza beyiyi ko. <verse eid="HEB 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 9:12" />Wukota nkumbu yimosi kaka mu kihinga kihyokidi kilongo, ka na menga ma nkombo zimbakala na ma baala ba ngombe ko, kansi na menga ma yandi bende. Ni bwabobo katukuudila ki mankululu mu masumu meto. <verse eid="HEB 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 9:13" />Menga ma nkombo zimbakala na ma ngombe zimbakala, mpe na bombe bu ngombe yinkento yi bayokidi, bu bedi bye mwakanga mu bantu basumuka, byedi bavedisanga, mpe mu nsadulu beyoyo byedi banatinanga mvedosolo yi nitu zawu. <verse eid="HEB 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 9:14" />Tala ti bwabobo, menga ma Klisto, yandi wukiyekola yandi bende ku Nzambi mu ngolo zi Mpeve yi mimvu ka mimvu bonso munkayulu wulembolo ba na kyeta, maavedisa mayindu meto mafulukidi mu nsadulu zikwe natanga ku lufwa, mwanki tusambila Nzambi yimoyo.<verse eid="HEB 9:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 9:15" />Ni hahoho, Klisto muwawisi kadi wu luwawanu lumoona, mwanki yobobo Nzambi ba katumisa, batambula fwa di mimvu ka mimvu di kabasila nsilulu. Bantu balendi bwe sa mu dyambu di lufwa luyiza. Mu lufwa belolo, bantu babakuula mu misamu mimbi mi bahidika mu luwawanu luntete.<verse eid="HEB 9:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 9:16" />Huma haa mukanda wusisidi muntu wufwa, bumbote budi mu lonka ti muntu bewowo wusonikini wo, wukedika ti wufwa kadi. <verse eid="HEB 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 9:17" />Mukanda wusisidi muntu wufwidi, wuu na mfunu tala ti muntu sonikini wo wufwa. Kansi, wuu na mfunu ko tala ti muntu sonikini wo wuu wumoyo. <verse eid="HEB 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 9:18" />Ni hahoho, luwawanu luntete lwabende, mu sa lo menga batengola . <verse eid="HEB 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 9:19" />Mose bu katanga kadi ntumunu ha ntadisi yi mukangu wumvimba bonso budi Misiku, wubonga menga ma baala ba ngombe na ma nkombo zimbakala. Mboki wuvwatisa mo na mamba, mpe wubonga mwa kintala ki muti wuu nkumbu isopi, wukanga ha nsongi yi muti mika mimbwaki. Wuvwanga myo mu menga na wumwaka mo bantu bamvimba na ha yulu buuku di Misiku, <verse eid="HEB 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="HEB 9:20" />na wuta ti: «Mamama ni menga ma luwawanu Nzambi kalutumini mu zitisa.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9.20</char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lulendi tanga mpe mu </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="EXO 24:3-8">Ndu 24.3-8</ref></char></note>» <verse eid="HEB 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="HEB 9:21" />Bumosi mpe Mose wumwaka menga mu nzo yi kikapu na mu bima bimvimba bikwe sadulungu mu sambila. <verse eid="HEB 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="HEB 9:22" />Bonso bu Misiku, mu menga bakwe vedisilanga bima bimvimba, kunaani ndemvokolo yi masumu tala ti menga matengokidi ko.<verse eid="HEB 9:22" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Munkayulu wu Klisto wukwe katulanga masumu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="HEB 9:23" />Tala ti bifwani bi misamu mikedika bii ku mazulu bya bakwe vedisilanga mu mutindu bewowo, buna bufweti ba ti misamu mikedika mii ku mazulu, mii mivedila mu minkayulu mye yoka mihyokidi mfunu. <verse eid="HEB 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="HEB 9:24" />Mu dyambu ti, Klisto kakota mu kihinga kilongo ki batungila mu moko ma bantu ko, kyokyokyo kiba kwandi kifwani ki kihinga ki makedika. Kansi wukota bwabu ku mazulu ku kadi ha ntadisi yi Nzambi mu dyambu dyeto. <verse eid="HEB 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="HEB 9:25" />Mfumu nganga-Nzambi yi Bayudayo kwe kotanga kadi mumvu mu kihinga kilongo na menga ma kibulu. Kansi, Klisto kakota mu kiyekola yandi bende nkumbu zizingi ko. <verse eid="HEB 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="HEB 9:26" />Tala ti kabobo ko, nganunu wuyena mpasi nkumbu zizingi tuuka ku mbadukulu yi nza! Kansi bwabu, mu ntangu yi nsukunu, wuyenika nkumbu yimosi mu katula masumu mu munkayulu wu yandi bende. <verse eid="HEB 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="HEB 9:27" />Bantu bakwe fwanga nkumbu yimosi kaka. Ku manima, bafundusu ku Nzambi. <verse eid="HEB 9:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="HEB 9:28" />Bumosi mpe Klisto bamuhaana bonso munkayulu nkumbu yimosi mu katula masumu ma bantu babingi. Waayenika nkumbu yinzole, ka mu katula masumu ko, kansi mu haana mpulusu ku bantu bana mukingila.<verse eid="HEB 9:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="HEB 10" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 10:1" />Misiku mi Mose midi kwandi kinsinsya ki bima bina kwiza kuntwala, kansi midi nkatika myabende kifwani ki bima bebyobyo ko. Ni hahoho, mii na lulendo ko lwe lungisa bantu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10.1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Bantu ba bana zonzila haha ni Mfumu nganga-Nzambi yi Bayudayo</char><char style="xt"><ref loc="HEB 9:25">9.25</ref></char></note> bebobo bana finama ku Nzambi, mu minkayulu mi bakwe tatamananga mu haana kadi ntangu, mpe kadi mumvu. <verse eid="HEB 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 10:2" />Tala ti bantu bebobo bakwe sambilanga Nzambi mu mutindu bewowo, bayiza ba nkumbu yimosi kaka bavedila, nganunu bazaba mu mayindu ti basidi dyaka na masumu ko. Buna, baketi bika mu haananga minkayulu mimvimba. <verse eid="HEB 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 10:3" />Kansi mu minkayulu bemyomyo, bantu bakwe bambukanga moyo mu masumu mawu kadi mumvu. <verse eid="HEB 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 10:4" />Mu dyambu ti, menga ma ngombe zimbakala na ma nkombo zimbakala malendi katula nakani masumu ko.<verse eid="HEB 10:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 10:5" />Ni hahoho, Klisto bu kedi kwiza mu nza, wuta ti:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 10:5">«Wuyangalala minkayulu mpe makabu ko,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 10:5">kansi ngeye nitu wumpaana.<verse eid="HEB 10:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 10:6" />Wuyena nakani kyese ko mu munkayulu we yoka kibulu kimvimba,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 10:6">na minkayulu mu dyambu di ndemvokolo yi masumu ko.<verse eid="HEB 10:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 10:7" />Buna nina ta ti: “Meno nina kwiza mebende ku ngeye, Oo Nzambi ani,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 10:7">mu sadila luzolo lwaku,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 10:7">bonso bu wudi wusonama mu buuku mu nkumbu ani.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10.7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lulendi tanga mpe mu </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 40:7-8">Mik 40.7-8</ref></char></note>”»<verse eid="HEB 10:7" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 10:8" />Wuta ntete ti:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 10:8">«Wuyangalala na wutambula</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 10:8">nakani munkayulu ko, nakani makabu ko,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 10:8">nakani munkayulu we yoka kibulu kimvimba ko,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 10:8">nakani minkayulu mu dyambu di ndemvokolo yi masumu ko.»</para>
  <para style="p" vid="HEB 10:8">Mpeleko Misiku mina lomba mu haana minkayulu bemyomyo. <verse eid="HEB 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 10:9" />Mboki wubwesa ta ti:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 10:9">«Meno nina kwiza mu sadila luzolo lwaku.»</para>
  <para style="p" vid="HEB 10:9">Ni bwabobo Nzambi, wukatula minkayulu mintama mu hingisa wu wandi. <verse eid="HEB 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 10:10" />Yesu-Klisto wusadila luzolo lu Nzambi. Wuyekola nitu andi nkumbu yimosi kaka ki mankululu, musamu wawowo wutunga dyaka kintwadi kyeto na Nzambi.<verse eid="HEB 10:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 10:11" />Kadi nganga-Nzambi kwe telamanga kadi kilumbu mu sala kisalu kyandi. Mpe kadi ntangu, minkayulu myamyomyo kwandi kakwe haananga mikwe lembolo katulanga masumu. <verse eid="HEB 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 10:12" />Kansi Klisto, bu kahaana munkayulu wumosi kwandi mu dyambu di masumu, mboki wuzakala mimvu ka mimvu ku kooko ku lubakala lu Nzambi. <verse eid="HEB 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 10:13" />Bwabu, kwakoko kana kingila ti Nzambi kasa mitantu myandi bitentokolo bi bitambi byandi. <verse eid="HEB 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 10:14" />Buna mu munkayulu wumosi, wulungisa mimvu ka mimvu bantu ba katunga dyaka kintwadi na Nzambi .<verse eid="HEB 10:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 10:15" />Mpeve Yilongo mpe wututeela wo kimbangi bu kata ti:<verse eid="HEB 10:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 10:16" />«Tala bwedi bwaabela luwawanu lu naatunga nawu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 10:16">ku manima ma bilumbu bebyobyo, Mfumu teedi ti:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 10:16">Naatuula ntumunu zani mu mitima myawu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 10:16">mpe naasonika zo mu mayindu mawu.<verse eid="HEB 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 10:17" />Naabambukila dyaka moyo masumu mawu na misamu myawu mimbi ko.»<verse eid="HEB 10:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 10:18" />Ni hahoho, ti masumu matambudi ndemvokolo, kusiidi dyaka mfunu ko mu haana minkayulu mu dyambu di masumu.<verse eid="HEB 10:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bantu baa mu nzila yi mpulusu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 10:19" />Ni hahoho zimpangi, tuu na kimpwanza mu kota mu kihinga ki hyokidi kilongo, mu dyambu di menga ma Yesu. <verse eid="HEB 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="HEB 10:20" />Wutuzibudila nzila yimoona na yimoyo mu hwahwa di mulele ha mwelo, mpila mosi ti, mu dyambu di nsuni andi. <verse eid="HEB 10:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="HEB 10:21" />Tweka bwabu na Mfumu Nganga-Nzambi yi batuudidi ha mutu wu nzo-Nzambi. <verse eid="HEB 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="HEB 10:22" />Tufinameeno bwabu ku Nzambi na mutima wu makedika, mpe na kiminu kimvimba, mutima wuvedila mu mayindu mambi na nitu yisukuka mu mamba mavedila. <verse eid="HEB 10:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="HEB 10:23" />Tusimbidileeno nakekete kivuvu kyeto ki tuna kwe samuningi, mu dyambu ti Nzambi wukwikama kadi mu nsilulu zandi. <verse eid="HEB 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="HEB 10:24" />Tusalasaneeno yeto na yeto, mwanki tusyamasana mu zola na mu hidika misamu mimbote. <verse eid="HEB 10:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="HEB 10:25" />Tunyafunandi mvukani zeto bonso bahiika bahikidi na kifu bekyokyo. Kansi tusyamasaneeno yeto na yeto, mu dyambu ti luna yena, kilumbu ki Mfumu kyeka lukufi.<verse eid="HEB 10:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="HEB 10:26" />Tala ti mu luzolo lweto, tuna tatamana mu sumuka, ku manima bu tumeni longoka kikedika, kusiidi dyaka munkayulu wulendi katula masumu ko. <verse eid="HEB 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="HEB 10:27" />Musamu wumosi wisidi, ni mu kingila mu bunkuta bubwingi, mfundusu yi Nzambi na tiya tungolo twaanyengisa mitantu myandi. <verse eid="HEB 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="HEB 10:28" />Tala ti muntu tinguni Misiku mi Mose, mu kimbangi ki bantu bole hoti batatu, bana muhonda wulembolo muyenina kyadi. <verse eid="HEB 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="HEB 10:29" />Tomeeno yindula bwedi bwabela bu nsembolo yihyokidi kitezo ku muntu nyafuni Mwana-Nzambi, safudi menga ma luwawanu ma bamubyekila ku Nzambi, mpe tyeki Mpeve yi mulemvo e? <verse eid="HEB 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="HEB 10:30" />Mu dyambu ti tuzebi yondowo wuta ti:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 10:30">«Meno naavutula mambi mu mambi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 10:30">mpe meno naavutula mvutu yifwanakani ku kadi muntu»,</para>
  <para style="m" vid="HEB 10:30">mpe wuta dyaka ti:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 10:30">«Mfumu waafundisa mukangu andi.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10.30 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lulendi tanga mpe mu</char><char style="xt"><ref loc="DEU 32:35-36">Mis 32.35-36</ref></char></note>»<verse eid="HEB 10:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="HEB 10:31" />Nsisi zidi mu bwa mu moko ma Nzambi yimoyo!<verse eid="HEB 10:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="HEB 10:32" />Bambukeeno moyo mu mpasi zi luyena mu ntangu yihyoka. Mu bilumbu bebyobyo, ku manima me tambula kya ku Nzambi, luyena mpasi zizingi, luvibidila mu nsinsani yingolo. <verse eid="HEB 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="HEB 10:33" />Bantu bahiika ha kati dyeno babatuka na babayenisa mpasi ha meso ma bantu. Kansi bahiika baba bakubama mu sadisa yobobo babedi yenisanga mpasi zi bobobo. <verse eid="HEB 10:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="HEB 10:34" />Luyena mpasi ha kimosi na zinkole, mpe lutambula mu kyese baluzika mvwilu eno, mu dyambu luzaba ti, ludi na bima bihyokidi bimvwama bikwe zinganga mimvu ka mimvu.<verse eid="HEB 10:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="HEB 10:35" />Bwabu luzimbisandi kivuvu kyeno ki lwaabakila musendo wunene. <verse eid="HEB 10:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="HEB 10:36" />Mu dyambu ti, luu na nsatu mu vibidila mu lungisa luzolo lu Nzambi na mu tambula nsilulu zi katusiila. <verse eid="HEB 10:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="HEB 10:37" />Mu dyambu ti, wusonama:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 10:37">«Mwa ntangu dyaka yifyoti, nkatika yifyoti kwandi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 10:37">mpe yondowo fweti kwiza waakwiza,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 10:37">kaazingila ko.<verse eid="HEB 10:37" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="HEB 10:38" />Muntu wulunungu ha meso mani, waazinga mu kiminu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 10:38">kansi tala ti vutukisi manima, naamuyangalala ko<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10.38 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lulendi tanga mpe mu</char><char style="xt"><ref loc="HAB 2:3-4">Abak 2.3-4</ref></char></note>.»<verse eid="HEB 10:38" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="HEB 10:39" />Yeto tudi bantu bebobo bakwe vutukisanga manima ko, mpe bana kwenda mu zimbala. Tudi bantu baa na kiminu na baa mu nzila yi mpulusu.<verse eid="HEB 10:39" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="HEB 11" />
  <para style="s1">Kiminu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 11:1" />Kiminu, ni mu kwikila mu bima bi tukwe siilanga kivuvu na mu tambula byo bi tukwe lembolo yenanga. <verse eid="HEB 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 11:2" />Mu dyambu di kiminu kyawu, zinkuluntu zi ntangu yintama zitambula kimbangi kimbote ku Nzambi.<verse eid="HEB 11:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 11:3" />Mu kiminu tukwe zabilanga ti, mu Mpova yi Nzambi nza yihidimina, mpe bima bikwe yenikanga, mu bima bikwe lembolo yenikanga bahidikila byo.<verse eid="HEB 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 11:4" />Mu kiminu, Abeli wuhaana ku Nzambi munkayulu wuvudidi wumbote na wu Kayini. Mu kiminu kyandi, Nzambi wumutumisina muntu wulunungu. Mu dyambu ti, Nzambi wuyangalala bima byandi bi kahaana. Mpeleko wufwa, kansi mu kiminu kyandi, Abeli wuna tatamana dyaka mu zonza.<verse eid="HEB 11:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 11:5" />Mu kiminu, Nzambi wunata Henoki ku mazulu mwanki kalembolo fwa. Kuu na muntu wubwesa muyena ko, mu dyambu ti Nzambi wumuzangula. Tekila nzangudulu andi, wutambula kimbangi ti, Nzambi wumuyangalala. <verse eid="HEB 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 11:6" />Kansi, kuu muntu ko wulendi yangidika Nzambi wulembolo ba na kiminu. Mu dyambu ti, yondowo kwe finamanga ku Nzambi, fweti kwikila ti Nzambi wudi na kwe sendanga yobobo bana musosa.<verse eid="HEB 11:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 11:7" />Mu kiminu, Nowa bamulwengisa ku Nzambi mu misamu mi balembolo teka yena. Wuba na kivumi kikinene, mpe wutunga nzaza mu vuukisa kanda dyandi. Mu kiminu bekyokyo wubedisa nza, mpe Nzambi ni kamubongila bonso muntu wulunungu.<verse eid="HEB 11:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 11:8" />Mu kiminu, Abalahami wutumimina Nzambi bu kamutumisa mu kwenda ku nsi yi kaamuhaana bonso fwa. Wuyenda wulembolo zaba ku kedi kwendisa. <verse eid="HEB 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 11:9" />Mu kiminu, wuzakala bonso nzenza ku nsi yi musila Nzambi nsilulu. Mu nzo yi kikapu kedi banga bonso Isaaki na Yakobi Nzambi bakasila nsilulu yimosi. <verse eid="HEB 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 11:10" />Mu dyambu ti, Abalahami wedi kingilanga mbanza yii na lufulu lungolo, lolo Nzambi lu kadi yandi bende Kihidiki na Kitungi.<verse eid="HEB 11:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 11:11" />Mu kiminu, Salayi yandi bende wuba kisita, mpe Nzambi wumuhaana lulendo lwe ba na nkuna, mpeleko wuba kinunu. Mu dyambu wuba na kivuvu kikwikama ti Nzambi waalungisa nsilulu zandi. <verse eid="HEB 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 11:12" />Ni hahoho, mu muntu wumosi, Abalahami wuba lukufi mu fwa, mubutuka nkuna yiyinene, yifunana bonso mbwetete ku yulu na bonso munyenge wuu ha kumu di mubu.<verse eid="HEB 11:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 11:13" />Mu kiminu bantu bebobo bamvimba bafwila, wulembolo tambula bima bi basila Nzambi nsilulu, kansi kukula bayenina byo na bayangalala byo. Babakula ti, zinzenza na mimpyoka nzila baba ha luse lu butoto. <verse eid="HEB 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 11:14" />Yobobo bana zonzila bobo, bana lonka ti nsi yi yawu bende bana kwe sosi. <verse eid="HEB 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 11:15" />Tala ti banyonga bu babambuka moyo mu nsi yi bafuma, nganunu babaka ntangu ye vutuka koko. <verse eid="HEB 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 11:16" />Kansi, baba na nsatu ye baka nsi yivudidi yimbote, mpila mosi ti nsi yii ku mazulu. Ni hahoho, Nzambi kana yena nsoni ko bamutumisina ti Nzambi awu, mu dyambu ti wubakubikila mbanza.<verse eid="HEB 11:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 11:17" />Mu kiminu, Abalahami wuhaana Isaaki bonso munkayulu mu ntangu Nzambi yi kamutonta. Wukubama mu haana mwana andi wumosi kaka bonso munkayulu, mpeleko Nzambi wumusila nsilulu. <verse eid="HEB 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 11:18" />Nzambi wumuteela ti: «Mu Isaaki waabakila nkuna yi nakusila nsilulu.» <verse eid="HEB 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 11:19" />Kansi, Abalahami wubanza ti Nzambi wuba na lulendo mu fulukisa Isaaki mu bafwa. Ni hahoho Nzambi kamuvutudila mwana andi, kyokyokyo kingana kwandi kidi.<verse eid="HEB 11:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="HEB 11:20" />Mu kiminu, Isaaki wusakumuna Yakobi na Esawu mu misamu mina kwiza kuntwala.<verse eid="HEB 11:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="HEB 11:21" />Mu kiminu, Yakobi tekila kafwa, wusakumuna kadi mwana wu Yosefi, mpe wusikimina mu nsongi yi muhangu andi na wusambila Nzambi.<verse eid="HEB 11:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="HEB 11:22" />Mu kiminu, Yosefi ku nsukunu yi luzingu lwandi, wuzonzila nduukulu yi baala ba Isaeli ku nsi yi Ngipiti na wuhaana ntumunu mu dyambu ditadidi bihisi byandi.<verse eid="HEB 11:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="HEB 11:23" />Mu kiminu, ku manima ma mbutukulu yi Mose, tata andi na ngudi andi bamusweka ngonda zitatu, mu dyambu bayena ti mwana awu wuba wuluhu na bayena bunkuta ko mu ntumunu zi ntinu.<verse eid="HEB 11:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="HEB 11:24" />Mu kiminu, Mose bu kakula, wubisa bamutumisina mwana wubakala wu mwana wu mukento wu Falao. <verse eid="HEB 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="HEB 11:25" />Wusoola bamukwamisa ha kimosi na mukangu wu Nzambi, kansi ka mu yangalala mu mwa ntangu mu byese bi masumu ko. <verse eid="HEB 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="HEB 11:26" />Wubanza ti, mu yena mvwezolo bonso Klisto, buvudidi mfunu na bimvwama bi nsi yi Ngipiti, mu dyambu ti wusikika meso mandi mu musendo wuna kwiza kuntwala.<verse eid="HEB 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="HEB 11:27" />Mu kiminu, Mose wusisa nsi yi Ngipiti, wulembolo yena bunkuta bu mankesi ma ntinu. Wutelama nakekete bonso muntu wuna yena Nzambi yikwe lembolo yenikanga. <verse eid="HEB 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="HEB 11:28" />Mu kiminu, wukembila mukembo wu Pake<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11.28 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lulendi tanga mpe mu </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="EXO 12:21">Ndu 12.21</ref></char></note> na wumwaka menga, mwanki mbazi yibatambika mu haana lufwa, yilembolo honda baala bantete babakala ba-Isaeli.<verse eid="HEB 11:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="HEB 11:29" />Mu kiminu, baala ba Isaeli basabuka mubu wumbwaki bonso ha yulu butoto buyuma. Kansi bisi-Ngipiti batonta mu sabuka, babadyamisa.<verse eid="HEB 11:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="HEB 11:30" />Mu kiminu, bibaka bi mbanza yi Yeliko bibwa, mu ntangu baala ba-Isaeli bu bazungidila yo mu bilumbu nsambwadi. <verse eid="HEB 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="HEB 11:31" />Mu kiminu, nsuza Lahabi kafwa ha kimosi na bantu banangumuka ko, mu dyambu ti wutambula minketi mu kiyenge.<verse eid="HEB 11:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="HEB 11:32" />Nki nalendi bwesa ta dyaka e? Naabaka dyaka ntangu ko ye zonzila Ngidoni, Balaki, Samisoni, Yefeti, Davidi, Samueli, mpe na mimbikudi. <verse eid="HEB 11:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="HEB 11:33" />Mu dyambu di kiminu babedisa bintinu, basadila lunungu mpe babaka byo Nzambi bi kabasila nsilulu. Bakanga minwa mi bankosi, <verse eid="HEB 11:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="HEB 11:34" />bazima tiya tungolo, bavuuka mu mbele yi mvita, baba na bimbevo, kansi babaka dyaka ngolo, balonka ngolo zawu ku mvita, mpe babedisa binwani bi zinsi zi nzenza. <verse eid="HEB 11:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="HEB 11:35" />Bakento bayena bantu bawu bafwa bafuluka mu bafwa, bahiika babayenisa mpasi zi lufwa bu babisa babakuula, mwanki bafuluka mu bafwa mpe batambula luzingu luvudidi lumbote.<verse eid="HEB 11:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="HEB 11:36" />Bahiika dyaka babayodila, babazuba bikoti, bababindika misinga na babatuula mu boloko. <verse eid="HEB 11:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="HEB 11:37" />Mwa bantu bahonda mu matadi, bahiika babazenga mu bibuku byole mu dingwengwe hoti babahondila mu mbele yi mvita. Bahiika dyaka, bayenda mu ndambu ka ndambu, baba balwata mikanda mi mameme hoti mi nkombo, baba zimputu, babafyetikisa na babakwamisa. <verse eid="HEB 11:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="HEB 11:38" />Mu yawu nza yiba yilunga ko! Ni bedi kwe dyengidingi ku nsi zinkatu na mu milandu, mu nsye zintadi na mu mabenga.<verse eid="HEB 11:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="HEB 11:39" />Bamvimba babateela kimbangi mu dyambu di kiminu kyawu, kansi batambula nsilulu zi basila Nzambi ko. <verse eid="HEB 11:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="HEB 11:40" />Mu dyambu ti Nzambi wutukubikila kima kivudidi mfunu. Buna Yandi katya ko ti ba balungisa wulembolo ba neto.<verse eid="HEB 11:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="HEB 12" />
  <para style="s1">Kutatamana mu ntontolo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 12:1" />Yeto mpe batuzungididi ku mpumbu yiyinene beyoyo yi zimbangi, tuloseeno bizitu bimvimba bina tukakidila mu dyata, sungula masumu mameni tulwata, tutatamaneeno mu nooka ntiinu zii ku mutwala eto. <verse eid="HEB 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 12:2" />Tusikikeeno meso meto mu Yesu, mu yandi kiminu kyeto kitonina mpe yandi kwe lungisanga kyo. Wutambula mu fwa ha kulunsi wulembolo yena nsoni, mu dyambu ti mu mayindu mandi wuyena kyese ki bamukubikila. Bwabu wuzakala kadi ha kooko ku lubakala lu kyandu ki kintinu ki Nzambi.<verse eid="HEB 12:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 12:3" />Bambukeeno moyo, bwedi kavibidila mpasi zi muyenisa minsumuki myedi mu belanga, mwanki lulembolo kota mu bunokina na mu lebakani. <verse eid="HEB 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 12:4" />Mu dyambu ti bu lukwe nwananga mvita mu bedisa masumu, lwanweni natee ku lufwa ko. <verse eid="HEB 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 12:5" />Luzimbakani kweno nsyamusunu yi luhaana Nzambi, bonso bu kakwe haaninanga yo ku baala bandi e?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 12:5">«Mwana ani, kuyinandi nsembolo zi Mfumu ko,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 12:5">Kulebakanandi bu kakwe kuhaananga masembo ko.<verse eid="HEB 12:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 12:6" />Mu dyambu ti Mfumu kwe sembanga yondowo wu katiidi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 12:6">
    <note caller="+" style="f">
      <char style="fr" closed="false">12.6 </char>
      <char style="ft" closed="false">Lulendi tanga mpe </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="PRO 3:11-12">Zin 3.11-12</ref>
      </char>
    </note>kwe sungikanga yondowo wu kazebi bonso mwana andi.»<verse eid="HEB 12:6" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 12:7" />Vibidileeno mpasi zina lusembila Nzambi: yandi kwe lubongilanga bonso baala bandi. Nganunu kuu na mwana wu bakwe lembolo sembanga ku tata andi e? <verse eid="HEB 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 12:8" />Tala ti balusembanga ko bonso bu bakwe sembanga baala bamvimba, buna luu nkatika baala ko, kansi baala bamakangu ludi. <verse eid="HEB 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 12:9" />Tubambukeeno moyo mu matata meto ma luse lu butoto: bedi tusembanga na twedi bavuminanga. Buna bwabobo mpe tufweti banga mu luyinunu ku Tata eto wuu ku yulu, mwanki tubaka luzingu. <verse eid="HEB 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 12:10" />Matata meto medi tusembanga mu mwa ntangu yifyoti, bonso bu bedi we yenanga wumbote. Kansi Nzambi kwe tusembanga mu dyambu di bumbote bweto, mwanki tuba bantu balongo bonso Yandi. <verse eid="HEB 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 12:11" />Mu ntangu yi bakwe tusembanga, tukwe yenanga kyese ko, kyadi kaka tukwe yenanga. Kansi kuntwala, masembo mbo mabuta mbutu zi kiyenge na lunungu ku yobobo batambudi mo.<verse eid="HEB 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Malongi na ndwengosolo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 12:12" />Kindiseeno bwabu moko meno malebakani, kindiseeno mpe makoto meno mana tekita. <verse eid="HEB 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 12:13" />Dyatileeno mu nzila zisungama, mwanki malu maa na byeta malembolo fisuka, kansi manyaka.<verse eid="HEB 12:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 12:14" />Soseeno kiyenge na bantu bamvimba na nkadulu yi bulongo. Kadi muntu walembolo ba na yo, kaayena Mfumu ko. <verse eid="HEB 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 12:15" />Kayeeno meso, mwanki nakani muntu, kalembolo hombisa mulemvo wu Nzambi. Kayeeno meso, nakani muntu kakitukandi mwanzi wundudi wuna mena, mpe wulendi ba kiyimbu kyabihisa bantu babingi. <verse eid="HEB 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 12:16" />Kayeeno meso, mwanki nakani muntu kasadilandi kindumba hoti kasafulandi bima bilongo ko, bonso Esawu wuyadika buhunda bwandi mu dyambu di bindya. <verse eid="HEB 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 12:17" />Mu dyambu waluzebi ti, ku manima, wusosa mu byadila fwa di lusakumunu, kansi kabaka dyo ko. Mpeleko wusosa dyo ku nsye bidilu mpe kabwesa baka dyaka hwahwa dihiika dye hidikila musamu bewowo ko.<verse eid="HEB 12:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 12:18" />Luyenda ba bela-bela na kima ki balendi simba ko, bonso mulandu wu Sinayi na tiya twandi tungolo, na mpimpa na tombe kyandi, na kitembo kyandi kikinene. <verse eid="HEB 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 12:19" />Kokoko luyuwa muningu wu kulumenta na ndinga yi zimpova, mpe yobobo bayuwa ndinga beyoyo, balomba ti babwesandi yuwa dyaka kani mpova yimosi. <verse eid="HEB 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="HEB 12:20" />Mu dyambu ti, bedi lenda ko mu vibidila ntumunu beyoyo yita ti: «Wonso waatula ha mulandu, kati kibulu, mu matadi baamuhondila!» <verse eid="HEB 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="HEB 12:21" />Dyambu bedyodyo di bayena, diba dinsisi, ni hahoho Mose kateela ti: «Kintekoto kii naani na bunkuta bubwingi nina yena<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12.21 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lulendi tanga mu </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="EXO 19:12-13">Ndu 19.12-13</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 9:18">Mis 9.18</ref></char> </note>!»<verse eid="HEB 12:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="HEB 12:22" />Kansi, yeno lwenzi ba bela-bela na mulandu wu Syoni mpe na mbanza yi Nzambi yimoyo, ni Yelusalemi yi mazulu, kuyonzamani mafunda na mafunda ma mbazi zi Nzambi, mu sa mukembo. <verse eid="HEB 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="HEB 12:23" />Yeno lwenzi ba bela-bela na bundu di baala bantete ba Nzambi, mpe nkumbu zawu zidi zisonama mu mazulu. Lwenzi ba mpe bela-bela na Nzambi, Mumfundisi wu bamvimba na zimpeve zi bantu balunungu zi balungisa. <verse eid="HEB 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="HEB 12:24" />Yeno lwenzi ba bela-bela na Yesu wudi muwawisi yi luwawanu lumoona na yi menga mandi matengoka, mpe mana zonza bubwingi kuhyoka dyaka menga ma Abeli.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12.24 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lulendi tanga mu </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="HEB 11:4">11.4</ref></char></note><verse eid="HEB 12:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="HEB 12:25" />Kebeeno kweno! Lubisandi mu yuwila yondowo wuna luzonzila ko. Yobobo babisa mu yuwila yondowo wedi balwengisanga ha luse lu butoto, bavuuka mu nsembolo ko. Yeto mpe twaavuuka ko tala ti tutekidi manima yondowo wuna tuzonzila tuuka ku mazulu. <verse eid="HEB 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="HEB 12:26" />Mu ntama, ndinga andi yizakimisa butoto. Kansi bwabu wutusididi nsilulu eyi ti: «Nkumbu yimosi dyaka, naazakimisa kaka butoto ko, kansi na yulu mpe.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12.26 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lulendi tanga mu </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="HAG 2:6">Han 2.6</ref></char></note>» <verse eid="HEB 12:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="HEB 12:27" />Mpova bezozo «nkumbu yimosi dyaka», zina lonka ti bima bi bahidika byaazakama mpe byaazimbala, mwanki byo byaasaala ni bima bikwe lembolo zakamanga.<verse eid="HEB 12:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="HEB 12:28" />Tuvutuleeno matondo mu dyambu ti tutambudi kintinu kikwe lembolo ningananga. Tulonkeeno mvutudulu yi matondo bemomo, mu sadila Nzambi mu nsadulu yina muyangidika, mu kivumi na bunkuta. <verse eid="HEB 12:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="HEB 12:29" />Mu dyambu ti Nzambi eto, tiya tukwe nyengisanga kadi.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12.29 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lulendi tanga mu </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="DEU 4:24">Mis 4.24</ref></char> </note><verse eid="HEB 12:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="HEB 13" />
  <para style="s1">Nkadulu yikwe yangidikanga Nzambi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 13:1" />Tatamaneeno mu zolasana yeno na yeno bonso zimpangi. <verse eid="HEB 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 13:2" />Luzimbakanandi kifu kye tambulanga zinzenza ko. Mu dyambu ti, bantu basadila kifu bekyokyo, batambula wulembolo zaba zimbazi zi Nzambi. <verse eid="HEB 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 13:3" />Bambukileeno moyo bantu baa mu boloko, bonso ti mu boloko ludi nawu ha kimosi. Bambukileeno moyo bantu ba bana kwamisa, mu dyambu ti yeno mpe nitu yii neno.<verse eid="HEB 13:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 13:4" />Bika bantu bamvimba bavumina makwela mpe mbuka yi makwela yifweti ba yilembolo safuka, mu dyambu ti Nzambi waafundisa bantu bakwe sadilanga kindumba na kinsuza.<verse eid="HEB 13:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 13:5" />Nzodi yi mbongo ka yiyaalandi nkadulu eno ko, sadileeno kwa zozozo zii neno, mu dyambu Nzambi yandi bende wuta ti: «Naakusisa ko, mpe naakuyambula ko.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13.5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lulendi tanga mpe mu</char><char style="xt"><ref loc="DEU 31:6">Mis 31.6</ref>,<ref loc="DEU 31:8">8</ref>; <ref loc="JOS 1:5">Yos 1.5</ref></char></note>» <verse eid="HEB 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 13:6" />Ni hahoho tulendi ta na kibakala kimvimba ti:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 13:6">«Mfumu ni Munsadisi ani,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 13:6">Naayena bunkuta ko,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 13:6">muntu nki kalendi nsa e<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13.6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lulendi tanga mpe mu </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 118:6">Mik 118.6</ref></char> </note>?»<verse eid="HEB 13:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 13:7" />Bambukeeno moyo mu mintwadisi myeno mi lusamunina Mambu ma Nzambi, yinduleeno bwedi bubeela nkadulu awu na bwedi bubeela nsukunu awu, mpe landeeno kiminu kyawu. <verse eid="HEB 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 13:8" />Yesu-Klisto wudi wumosi mazono, bubedidi, mpe mimvu ka mimvu. <verse eid="HEB 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 13:9" />Lubikandi ba luhuna mu ndongosolo zinzenza zimumpila-mumpila ko. Mu dyambu ti, mutima wufweti baka ngolo mu mulemvo wu Nzambi, kansi ka mu bindya ko. Yobobo bakwe vuminanga misiku bemyomyo mi bindya, babakilanga myo ndandu ko.<verse eid="HEB 13:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 13:10" />Zinganga-Nzambi zikwe salanga mu kati di kihinga kilongo ki Bayudayo, baa na luve mu dya bima bi baheeni munkayulu ha yulu kuku dyeto dye yokila minkayulu ko. <verse eid="HEB 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 13:11" />Mfumu nganga-Nzambi yi Bayudayo kwe natanga menga ma bibulu mu kati di kihinga kihyokidi kilongo, mwanki kahaana mo bonso munkayulu mu dyambu di ndemvokolo yi masumu. Kansi, mbizi zi bibulu bebyobyo, ku mbazi yi mbanza bakwe ze yokilanga.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13.11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lulendi tanga mpe mu </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="LEV 16:27">KdL 16.27</ref> </char> </note> <verse eid="HEB 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 13:12" />Ni hahoho mpe Yesu kafwila ku mbazi yi mbanza, mwanki kavedisa bantu mu menga mandi. <verse eid="HEB 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 13:13" />Yeto mpe bwabu, twendeeno ku yandi ku mbazi yi mbanza, mpe tutambuleeno mvwezolo bonso yandi. <verse eid="HEB 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 13:14" />Mu dyambu ti, tuu na mbanza yi mimvu ka mimvu ha luse lu butoto ko, kansi tuna kwe sosi mbanza yo yina kwiza kuntwala. <verse eid="HEB 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 13:15" />Mu Yesu, tutatamaneeno mu haananga ku Nzambi munkayulu wu matondo, mpila mosi ti mpova zi munwa zina kembila nkumbu andi. <verse eid="HEB 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 13:16" />Lwakazimbakana mu hidikanga misamu mimbote na mu salasananga yeno na yeno mu kimpangi, mu dyambu ti myo midi minkayulu mikwe yangidikanga Nzambi.<verse eid="HEB 13:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 13:17" />Tumimineeno mintwadisi myeno na beeno bantu baluyinunu ku yawu. Mu dyambu ti yawu bana kaya meso ntangu zimvimba mu myela myeno, kadi yawu baayala mpolo ku Nzambi mu dyambu dyeno. Basadiseeno batoma sala kisalu kyawu mu kyese, kansi ka mu manyongo ko, nganunu lwaabakila kyo ndandu ko.<verse eid="HEB 13:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 13:18" />Tusambidileeno! Tuzebi ti mabanza mambote maa neto, mu dyambu ti tutiidi kadi ntangu, tudyatila mu nkadulu yimbote. <verse eid="HEB 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 13:19" />Nina lulomba lusambila, mwanki Nzambi kampaana hwahwa dye vutukila munswalu ku yeno.<verse eid="HEB 13:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lusambulu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="HEB 13:20" />Bika Nzambi yi kiyenge, yifulukisa Mfumu eto Yesu mu bafwa, yandi wudi munkengi wuwunene wu mameme, wutunga mu menga mandi luwawanu lu mimvu ka mimvu, <verse eid="HEB 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="HEB 13:21" />kaluhaana lulendo lwe hidikila misamu mimvimba mimbote, mu sadila luzolo lwandi. Kalungisa ha kati dyeto myo mina muyangidika, mu nkumbu Yesu-Klisto, fwanakani mu tambula nkembo yi mimvu ka mimvu. Ameni!<verse eid="HEB 13:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mbote zimansukina</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="HEB 13:22" />Zimpangi, nina lulomba luvibidila mu yuwa mpova bezizi zi nsyamusunu, mu dyambu ti mukanda wuwukufi kwandi nalusonikini. <verse eid="HEB 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="HEB 13:23" />Zabeeno ti mpangi eto Timote wubeki kimpwanza. Kamana tula mu ntangu yimbote, naakwiza luyena ha kimosi nandi.<verse eid="HEB 13:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="HEB 13:24" />Haaneeno mbote ku mintwadisi myeno mimvimba na ku yobobo bamvimba bavwihulu ku Nzambi. Zimpangi zii ku nsi yi Itali, balutambikidi mpe mbote.<verse eid="HEB 13:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="HEB 13:25" />Bika lusakumunu lu Nzambi luba mu yeno bamvimba!<verse eid="HEB 13:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 13" />
</usx>